  "tags": ["bulkhead", "isolation", "resources"],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "The bulkhead pattern isolates resources so a failure in one service does not exhaust resources for others. Like bulkheads in a ship."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "data": {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Key Concepts"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "key-terms",
      "data": {
        "terms": [
          {
            "term": "Bulkhead",
            "definition": "Isolating resources to prevent cascade failures."
          },
          {
            "term": "Thread Pool Isolation",
            "definition": "Separate thread pool per dependency."
          },
          {
            "term": "Semaphore Isolation",
            "definition": "Limit concurrent calls per dependency."
          },
          {
            "term": "Resource Exhaustion",
            "definition": "When a service uses all available resources."
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "data": {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Bulkhead Concept"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "Like a ship with bulkheads that prevent flooding from spreading, a system with bulkheads prevents one failing service from exhausting all resources."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "data": {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Isolation Strategies"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "data": {
        "headers": ["Strategy", "Description", "Overhead"],
        "rows": [
          ["Thread pool", "Separate thread pool per dependency", "Higher"],
          ["Semaphore", "Limit concurrent calls per dependency", "Lower"],
          ["Process", "Separate process per service", "Highest"]
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "data": {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Benefits"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "bullet-list",
      "data": {
        "items": [
          "Prevents resource exhaustion",
          "Contains failures to one dependency",
          "Improves overall stability",
          "Protects against slow dependencies"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "data": {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Implementation"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "Limit concurrent calls and threads per dependency. If one dependency is slow, only its pool is affected, not the entire application."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "data": {
